<title>USA: Biora among ADR most actives at launch.</title>
<headline>Biora among ADR most actives at launch.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish biotechnology company Biora AB was among the most heavily traded American Depositary Receipts (ADRs) during its launch on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company's ADR's were up 2-1/4 at 18-3/4 after opening at 20. Volume was a heavy 1.6 million shortly before the close.</p>
<p>Biora, based in Malmo, Sweden, develops, makes and sells products for the treatment of periodontal disease and for use in oral surgery. Its main product, Emdogain, is used to treat defects caused by periodontal disease.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
